# Recruitzaa — Backend Architecture Plan (v1 — Enterprise Grade)

> **Authored by**: Senior Backend Architect (10 YOE perspective)  
> **Stack**: Python (FastAPI) · Microservices · MongoDB + PostgreSQL + Redis  
> **Auth**: Firebase Admin SDK (RBAC — CANDIDATE / EMPLOYER / SUPER_ADMIN)  
> **Scraping**: Playwright + Scrapling/nodriver  
> **AI Modules**: OpenAI GPT-4o · Custom NLP · LangChain  
> **Android**: REST-compatible (same APIs consumed by Android client)  
> **Concurrency**: Async Python (asyncio) + Celery + Redis · Enterprise-grade

