## 7. Scraper Service — Architecture

### 7.1 Supported Job Sources (Phase 1)
| Source | Method | Frequency |
|---|---|---|
| LinkedIn Jobs | Playwright (browser automation) | Every 4 hours |
| Indeed | Playwright + nodriver | Every 4 hours |
| Naukri.com | Playwright + nodriver | Every 6 hours |
| TimesJobs | Scrapling (CSS-based) | Every 6 hours |
| Glassdoor | Playwright headless | Every 8 hours |
| Company career pages | Scrapling (configurable templates) | Daily |

### 7.2 Scraper Architecture
```
Scraper Scheduler (APScheduler / Celery Beat)
    │
    ├── Dispatches scrape jobs to: Redis Queue (scrape_tasks)
    │
    ▼
Scraper Worker Pool (multiple async Playwright contexts)
    │
    ├── Playwright Browser Pool (chromium headless)
    │     ├── Context 1: LinkedIn scraper
    │     ├── Context 2: Indeed scraper
    │     └── Context N: Other sources
    │
    ├── nodriver (for anti-bot protected sites)
    │
    ├── Scrapling (fast CSS-based scraping for supported sites)
    │
    ▼
Normalization Pipeline
    ├── Raw HTML → structured fields (title, company, location, salary, tags)
    ├── De-duplication (hash of title+company+location → check Redis set)
    ├── NLP tagging (spaCy: extract skills, experience level from description)
    ├── Geocoding (location normalization to standard city/country)
    └── Status: PENDING → queued for ADMIN approval or auto-approve if verified
    │
    ▼
MongoDB (scraped_raw + jobs collections) → Emit job.scraped event
```

### 7.3 Scraper APIs
```
POST /api/scraper/trigger            → Manual scrape trigger (ADMIN)
GET  /api/scraper/jobs               → View scraped jobs queue (ADMIN)
POST /api/scraper/approve/{job_id}   → Approve scraped job (ADMIN)
GET  /api/scraper/stats              → Scraping stats (runs, success rate)
PUT  /api/scraper/sources            → Update source configs (ADMIN)
```

### 7.4 Anti-Detection Strategy
```python
# Playwright config per scraper:
{
  "headless": True,
  "user_agent": [rotated list of real UAs],
  "proxy": ["rotating residential proxy pool"],
  "viewport": random_viewport(),
  "locale": "en-IN",
  "geolocation": {...},
  "stealth_mode": True,  # playwright-stealth plugin
  "human_delays": True,  # random sleep between actions
  "fingerprint_rotation": True  # nodriver handles this
}
```

