## 8. Notification Service

```
Event Consumers:
  user.registered      → Send welcome email (CANDIDATE or EMPLOYER variant)
  application.applied  → Notify employer + confirm to candidate
  application.updated  → Notify candidate of stage change (email + FCM push)
  job.approved         → Notify employer their job is live
  job.rejected         → Notify employer with rejection reason
  job.match.found      → Push notification to candidate (new matching job)
  interview.scheduled  → Email + push + calendar invite
```

**Stack:**
- Email: SendGrid / AWS SES
- Push: Firebase Cloud Messaging (Android + Web)
- In-app: Real-time via WebSocket (FastAPI WebSocket / Socket.IO)
- Templates: Jinja2 HTML email templates

