## 14. Android App Compatibility

The REST API is **100% compatible** with Android. No protocol changes needed:

```
Android (Kotlin / Retrofit) → Firebase getIdToken() → 
  → Authorization: Bearer <token> → Same Backend APIs
  
Additional endpoints for Android:
  POST /auth/fcm-token          → Register device FCM token for push
  GET  /notifications/inbox     → In-app notifications
  POST /notifications/{id}/read → Mark as read
  
Android-specific headers:
  X-Platform: android
  X-App-Version: 1.0.0
```

